Please see evidence file called QuickCart Mini E-Commerce.docx for PM03 JAVASCRIPT DOM PRACTICAL QuickCart Mini E-Commerce.

Purpose of this active was to create a active cart webpage, which can allow the user to add and remove items from a cart, as well as give them an option to put in a item with price into the cart. The user can also search for an Item as well.

From of AI and research was used to help with neating up the code, adding comments and correcting errors.
